# A second table lamp for the lamp slot (issue 074): a tall conical shade in tangerine and butter with a brick trim over a round brick-red ceramic base, on the same small dark-wood table and at the same angle as lamp-table so it swaps in. Warmer and more orange than the linen drum shade.
size: 16x16
